  <h1 class="research-title">Flashcards</h1>
  <p class="ref-lede">Learn the words, faces, capitals and dates of history a few cards at a time. Turn a card over and say whether you knew it: the cards you miss come back the same day, the ones you know wait a little longer each time. Your progress is kept in this browser.</p>
