<section class="fc-how" aria-labelledby="fc-how-t">
  <h2 class="ref-sec-title" id="fc-how-t">How it works</h2>
  <p>Every card starts in the first of five boxes. A round deals up to twenty cards: the ones due today first, then a few new ones. <b>Knew it</b> moves a card up a box, and it waits longer before it comes back: a day, then two, four, eight and sixteen days. <b>Again</b> sends it back to the first box, and you see it once more before the round ends. A card in the fourth box or higher counts as learned.</p>
  <p>Keys: <kbd>Space</kbd> turns the card, <kbd>1</kbd> or <kbd>&larr;</kbd> is Again, <kbd>2</kbd> or <kbd>&rarr;</kbd> is Knew it. On a phone, swipe the turned card right if you knew it and left to see it again. In Kids mode the decks deal only cards with a picture.</p>
</section>
